## The problems

<ProblemTable ticket={4471} />

## How each report was placed

1. Count each report id once. The ticket export repeats rows where its pages overlap.
2. The tenant decides, not intake's tag ([causes.ts](/kb/triage/dedupe)):
   a `form` report from a `booking-v3` tenant is `hint`; every other day-first report is `parser`.
3. Reports the desk read as a one-day move stay with their tenant's problem, footnoted.

## Why it was one ticket

Reports were merged on subject line ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)).
Every subject here says "wrong day". The subject names the symptom; the cause is in the
tenant, the channel and the body.

